{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c2a1bc22fc6fe8ea447f05706a56d4a84b9b85279bfef610b2e8fd57c5cd3e34","ja":"神秘的な森や街並み……せっかくなので、\nゆっくり眺めたいなと思ったんです～。","zh":"神秘的森林与街景……难得来一次，\n就想着好好欣赏一番呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b599f4c4260ab5c87b058d2baf31037a7bc7b599166e422d7d9223a3c1ee4d8c","ja":"わあ～っ……本当にキレイだねっ！","zh":"哇～……真的好漂亮啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9c3121e18721cdacffe7b7a988c8a48623cdeacc047863ef8c77e7db8b673cd1","ja":"はい。描かれた方のこだわりを感じます～。\nとっても素晴らしいですね～♪","zh":"是的。能感受到作画者的讲究呢～。\n非常棒呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4a3a7634eacaa5ea9b72e0698d64c4e0510d23a9f9e9c81b2164903829a68bbf","ja":"ゲームって、すっごくたくさんの人が\n作品に愛情込めて作ってくれてるんですよね！","zh":"游戏其实凝聚了非常多人的心血，\n倾注了对作品满满的爱才制作出来的呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1122b71aeb44bed001e7da1328520bd4daca5132dc0c3420afcece9500c2b7e5","ja":"だから私たちがゲームの主題歌を歌えたのって、\nすっごく幸せだなーって！","zh":"所以能由我们来演唱游戏的主题曲，\n真的觉得超级幸福呢——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8f7c278564c5df7112e503cc3f4689ada09aaabb30b562e51d69a16b1ca6a40b","ja":"はい！　それに、私たちの愛情も、\nバッチリ込められましたよね！","zh":"好的！而且，我们的爱意也\n充分注入进去了对吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"19b682992d359d18042a59ada70ac46d1b45b85b4d75a7c045aab44477865309","ja":"あ、そうだ！　もうネットに私たちの主題歌とか、\nゲームの感想が投稿され始めてるんじゃないかな？","zh":"啊，对了！网上现在是不是已经开始有人\n发表对我们主题曲还有游戏的感想了呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"411810d207e74459c05fdbebc32c4fc04286e0f7347d40e0c88f5bc86138dc26","ja":"ええっ、もうですか？","zh":"咦，已经好了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"75be2aa5cb2fc3fe6ff98c85519aaa98da6cdd5a75993627213999dbff30f73d","ja":"熱心なファンなら多分。\nちょっと見てみますね……。","zh":"热心的粉丝或许会知道。\n我来看看哦……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9848b91c75783f8b3ea8d246e151d928bf50603a6295906c498ab481b6ee039d","ja":"……ああああっ！！\nちょ、ちょっとこれは……そんな……！","zh":"……啊啊啊啊！！\n等、等等，这……怎么会……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"b489859e097e7a78c2fca4d08f015b1738ae3094a7eeb08e33fe5854d5c7b1b2","ja":"百合子ちゃん、どうしたの……わあっ！？\nネタバレ！？　待って待って～！","zh":"百合子，怎么了……哇啊！？\n剧透！？等等，等等～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"79b7d6fb5c6f5ecf62286bea703c4e3ae2757d0eac61f7299603d93f4c7fffa1","ja":"もうこんなにたくさんの人が、\nネットでゲームの内容を話してるんですね～……。","zh":"已经有这么多人，\n在网上讨论游戏的内容了呢～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d64ea19d8521cdcafa2f0177fd6a3b39f567e056919e4811fc57223c88bed1c9","ja":"でもこれは～……\nプレイする前に見るべきではないですね～。","zh":"不过这个嘛～……\n在玩之前还是不看为妙呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"a50b236cf48e115b93a084d1defdb482a1d076d90465940dfdf22a4fd3971fd1","ja":"となると……ふふっ、さっそくみんなで\nプレイしようよ！　クリアまでネタバレ禁止で！","zh":"这样的话……呵呵，马上大家一起来\n玩吧！在通关之前禁止剧透哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1022.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"945e8d4abcf6daf579aa0ce1f9740e2d06de7909eca899e4d84567849ab3e0c3","ja":"そうですね～。では、ゲームを楽しみましょう～♪","zh":"好的～。那么，好好享受游戏吧～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
